  "steps": [
    "Here’s what you need: (For 6 sandwiches)",
    "Get you pan to medium heat, 1 tsp oil, 1 tsp cumin seeds, 3 pods of garlic cut into bits, 1 small chopped onion, 1 tomato, 1 tsp turmeric, 1 tsp chilli powder, 1/2 tsp garam masala, 1 tsp salt, Mix well and let it cook for 3 minutes on medium heat, Then add 1 small capsicum (1/2 green 1/2 red is a good option), Add 200gms low fat paneer cut into small bits, Mix well.",
    "Here’s how to make 1 sandwich:.",
    "To a hot pan, toast 2 slices bread with 1 tsp butter (let it rest on medium heat for 2 minutes in total), Then add your paneer mix (2 tbsp), 1 slice cheese, Continue to toast till golden brown."
  ],
